3
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:18,690
The NH columns count only the part that is not hedged.

4
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:24,620
The cross in Close closes all positions in that row, for every client. Use it with care.

5
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:28,350
Day Summary counts only today's positions; Shift Summary, the current shift.

6
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:37,960
